## COMMON MISTAKES TO AVOID
[err-00003] helpful=0 harmful=0 :: Attempting an extra Pick after the target object is already in hand. This is redundant and can cause an invalid-action error; once the target is held, terminate instead of continuing.
[err-00004] helpful=0 harmful=0 :: Failing to maintain internal state about hand contents and goal completion. A later failed action does not necessarily mean the overall task failed if the goal was already satisfied earlier.
[/PERSISTENT EXPERIENCE GUIDANCE]